{"id":"637946","name":"牛肉丸云吞","author":"向着、阳光走！","authorId":"11081925","desc":"","cover":"images/637946/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"云吞","amount":"100g"},{"name":"牛肉丸","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"大白菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3只"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"热油煎鸡蛋。","img":"images/637946/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煎好备用。","img":"images/637946/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水开倒入牛肉丸，加少许生姜去腥。","img":"images/637946/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入云吞和牛肉丸一起煮。","img":"images/637946/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"等牛肉丸和云吞煮熟后，倒入大白菜。","img":"images/637946/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最后加入煎蛋，放水许盐，生抽调味即可。","img":"images/637946/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后放少许葱花即可食用。","img":"images/637946/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"牛肉丸是冰冻的，加少许姜可去腥去寒。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}